  "description": [
    "Where the Flutter sample apps actually receive a lifecycle stimulus in Dart.",
    "Each seat names a canonical cio-lifecycle-trace/1 callback (the contract's closed",
    "enum owns the names; none are invented here), the sample expression that consumes",
    "it, and the exact pinned plugin source that delivers it. Digests are taken from an",
    "isolated PUB_CACHE resolution, so a plugin bump that moves or renames a seat fails",
    "the check instead of silently invalidating the mapping.",
    "This is a source-level (L0) mapping. It is not runtime evidence and asserts nothing",
    "about delivery, ordering, or evidence level."
  ],
